@using pizzashop_n_tier
@using pizzashop_n_tier.Models
@addTagHelper *, Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc.TagHelpers



@* Connverting Old project to N-Tier
 
Create Solution
1.dotnet new sln -n PizzaShopSolution
 
Presentation Layer
2.dotnet new mvc -n PizzaShop.Web
 
Business Logic Layer
3.dotnet new classlib -n PizzaShop.Business
 
DataAccess Layer
4.dotnet new classlib -n PizzaShop.DataAccess
 
Entities(Model Layer)
5.dotnet new classlib -n PizzaShop.Entities
 
Add Project to Solution
6.dotnet sln PizzaShopSolution.sln add PizzaShop.Web/PizzaShop.Web.csproj
7.dotnet sln PizzaShopSolution.sln add PizzaShop.Business/PizzaShop.Business.csproj
8.dotnet sln PizzaShopSolution.sln add PizzaShop.DataAccess/PizzaShop.DataAccess.csproj
9.dotnet sln PizzaShopSolution.sln add PizzaShop.Entities/PizzaShop.Entities.csproj
 
Add Project Reference
 
*Business Layer (BLL) needs DataAccess and Entities
10.dotnet add PizzaShop.Business/PizzaShop.Business.csproj reference PizzaShop.DataAccess/PizzaShop.DataAccess.csproj
11.dotnet add PizzaShop.Business/PizzaShop.Business.csproj reference PizzaShop.Entities/PizzaShop.Entities.csproj
 
*DataAccess Layer needs Entities
12.dotnet add PizzaShop.DataAccess/PizzaShop.DataAccess.csproj reference PizzaShop.Entities/PizzaShop.Entities.csproj
 
*Web Layer needs Business Layer
13.dotnet add PizzaShop.Web/PizzaShop.Web.csproj reference PizzaShop.Business/PizzaShop.Business.csproj
 
 
go to project which willl run
14. cd PizzaShop.Web
 
 
*Installed packages
 
*In PizzaShop.Web
15.dotnet add package Npgsql.EntityFrameworkCore.PostgreSQL
16.dotnet add package Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore.Tools
 
 
*In PizzaShop.DataAccess
17.dotnet add package Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore
18.dotnet add package Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore.Design
 
 
Also add other needed package *@
